---
/* Rich body for the "Understanding webinar organizers" case study.
   A 2-minute, decision-led read: context, three decisions, the result.
   Optional detail sits behind CaseDetail expanders. The shared
   [slug].astro template renders this when the slug matches and passes
   the summary through the slot.
   Shared .rwc-* layout/typography lives in global.css; image
   lightbox in CaseBodyLightbox.astro. */
import CaseBodyLightbox from './CaseBodyLightbox.astro';
import CaseDetail from './CaseDetail.astro';
import CaseReadBar from './CaseReadBar.astro';
---

<div class="rwc-body">

  {/* HERO */}
  <section class="rwc-hero" id="case-context">
    <div class="rwc-hero-left">
      <div class="case-cat" data-pt={'Caso de estudo · Descoberta dos webinars On-Air'}>Case study · On-Air webinars discovery</div>
      <h1 class="case-title" data-pt={'Perceber os organizadores de webinars'}>Understanding webinar organizers</h1>
      <p class="case-subtitle" data-pt={'O primeiro grande estudo da StreamYard sobre organizadores de webinars: entrevistas com 11 organizadores experientes, testes de conceito e um mapa de jornada que a empresa inteira usou.'}>
        StreamYard's first major study of webinar organisers: interviews with 11
        experienced organisers, concept tests, and a journey map the whole company used.
      </p>
      <dl class="rwc-aside rwc-facts">
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Função'}>Role</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Staff Product Designer, co-responsável pela pesquisa'}>Staff Product Designer, research co-lead</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Responsabilidades'}>Responsibilities</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Designer principal, co-investigador'}>Lead designer, co-researcher</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Equipa'}>Team</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'Eu e um lead researcher, com designers a tomar notas'}>Myself and a lead researcher, with designers as notetakers</dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt data-pt={'Duração'}>Duration</dt>
          <dd data-pt={'3 meses'}>3 months</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>

    <div class="rwc-hero-right">
      <div class="case-img-ph rwc-hero-img is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/hero.webp" alt="StreamYard webinar registration UI — welcome to the webinar" data-pt-alt={'UI de registo de webinars do StreamYard — boas-vindas ao webinar'} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
      </div>
      <p class="case-img-caption" data-pt={'Imagem do StreamYard, via streamyard.com'}>Image by StreamYard via streamyard.com</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Summary, passed in from [slug].astro */}
  <slot />

  <CaseReadBar minutes={3} />

  {/* CONTEXT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-challenge">
    <div class="rwc-challenge">
      <div class="rwc-challenge-text">
        <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Contexto'}>Context</div>
        <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'O roadmap não tinha uma visão de longo prazo dos organizadores'}>The roadmap had no long-term picture of organisers</h2>
        <p data-pt={'Um ano depois de lançar os webinars On-Air, definíamos o roadmap pontuando iniciativas a partir de chamadas de vendas, pedidos de suporte, pedidos nos town halls da empresa e benchmarks da concorrência. Isso aproximou-nos das necessidades centrais e dos concorrentes, mas não tínhamos uma visão de longo prazo do que o produto devia vir a ser.'}>
          A year after launching On-Air webinars, we set the roadmap by scoring
          initiatives from sales calls, support requests, company town hall asks
          and competitive benchmarks. That got us closer to the core needs and to
          our competitors, but we had no long-term view of what the product should
          become next.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-challenge-img">
        <div class="case-img-ph is-filled" data-ratio="4-3">
          <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/registration.webp" alt="On-Air webinar registration page, April 2024" data-pt-alt={'Página de registo de webinars On-Air, abril de 2024'} loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <p class="case-img-caption" data-pt={'Página de registo de webinars On-Air, abril de 2024.'}>On-Air webinar registration page, April 2024.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 1 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-recruit">
    <div class="rwc-challenge">
      <div class="rwc-challenge-text">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 1'}>Decision 1</div>
      <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Recrutar fora da nossa base de utilizadores'}>Recruit outside our user base</h2>
      <p data-pt={'Decidimos entrevistar pessoas que não usavam a StreamYard: organizadores de webinars muito experientes, que pagavam por um produto semelhante e podiam vir a ser nossos utilizadores. Um questionário de seleção no User Interviews encontrou 11 participantes adequados, da saúde, da educação e da comunicação empresarial.'}>
        We chose to interview people who didn't use StreamYard: highly experienced
        webinar organisers who were paying for a similar product and could become
        our users. A screener survey on User Interviews found 11 fitting
        participants, from healthcare, education and corporate comms.
      </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-challenge-img">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-10">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/screener.webp" width="1024" height="522" alt="User Interviews screener survey v2" data-pt-alt={'Questionário de triagem v2 no User Interviews'} loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 2 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-concept-test">
    <div class="rwc-challenge">
      <div class="rwc-challenge-text">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 2'}>Decision 2</div>
      <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Um teste de conceito em cada entrevista'}>A concept test in every interview</h2>
      <p data-pt={'Depois de cada entrevista, guardávamos 20 minutos para um cenário de utilizador: mostrávamos estímulos de uma possível nova funcionalidade, fazíamos cenários de tarefas e recolhíamos feedback. A reação ao conceito foi muito positiva, o que nos deu confiança para avançar.'}>
        After each interview we kept 20 minutes for a user scenario: we showed
        stimuli for a potential new feature, ran task scenarios and gathered
        feedback. The response to the concept was highly positive, which gave us
        the confidence to go ahead with it.
      </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-challenge-img">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-10">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/interview.webp" width="994" height="501" alt="Zoom interview screenshot with participant" data-pt-alt={'Captura de ecrã de uma entrevista no Zoom com um participante'} loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* DECISION 3 */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-journey-map">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Decisão 3'}>Decision 3</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'Um mapa de jornada, não um relatório'}>A journey map, not a report</h2>
    <p data-pt={'Transcrevemos as entrevistas no Dovetail, etiquetámos os pontos relevantes e agrupámos as notas em áreas de insight, como adequação ao produto, necessidades de envolvimento, necessidades pós-webinar e impressões sobre a concorrência. Daí saiu um mapa de jornada com cinco fases, do planeamento à reutilização e partilha. Foi feito para crescer com a chegada de novos insights, para aprofundar passos individuais e para ser dividido por segmento de utilizadores.'}>
      We transcribed the interviews in Dovetail, labelled the relevant points and
      grouped the notes into insight areas such as product fit, engagement needs,
      post-webinar needs and competitor impressions. Those became a journey map
      with five stages, from planning to repurposing and sharing. It was built to
      grow as new insights came in, to drill into single steps, and to split by
      user segment.
    </p>

    <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-9">
      <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/journey-map.webp" width="1522" height="964" alt="Webinar organizers' journey map — Plan / Prepare / Run / Debrief / Repurpose and Share" data-pt-alt={'Journey map dos organizadores de webinars — Planear / Preparar / Realizar / Balanço / Reaproveitar e partilhar'} loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <CaseDetail label="From notes to insights" labelPt="Das notas aos insights">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="16-9">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/insights-board.webp" width="1408" height="444" alt="Dovetail-tagged interview notes aggregated into insight clusters" data-pt-alt={'Notas de entrevistas etiquetadas no Dovetail, agregadas em clusters de insights'} loading="lazy" />
      </div>
    </CaseDetail>
  </section>

  {/* RESULT */}
  <section class="rwc-section" id="case-impact">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-pt={'Resultado'}>Result</div>
    <h2 class="rwc-h2" data-pt={'A empresa inteira ficou com a mesma visão'}>The whole company got the same picture</h2>

    <div class="rwc-stats">
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n" data-pt={'1<span class="rwc-stat-unit">.ª</span>'}>1<span class="rwc-stat-unit">st</span></div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Base de conhecimento de insights de base sobre webinars criada na empresa.'}>
          Knowledgebase of foundational webinar insights created in the
          company.
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">2</div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Pods informados com dados relevantes entre pods (Growth e Library).'}>
          Pods briefed with relevant cross-pod data (Growth and Library).
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rwc-stat">
        <div class="rwc-stat-n">5</div>
        <div class="rwc-stat-desc" data-pt={'Insights usados no trabalho de produto em curso.'}>
          Insights used into ongoing product work.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rwc-challenge">
      <div class="rwc-challenge-text">
      <p data-pt={'Apresentámos os insights e o mapa de jornada à empresa inteira. A equipa de Growth usou insights específicos para gerar hipóteses e correr novos testes, a pensar no crescimento do topo do funil.'}>
        We presented the insights and the journey map to the entire company. The
        growth team used particular insights to generate hypotheses and run new
        tests aimed at top-of-funnel growth.
      </p>
      </div>

      <div class="rwc-challenge-img">
      <div class="case-img-ph is-filled is-whole" data-ratio="4-3" style="max-width:571px">
        <img src="/assets/images/cases/sy-research/slack-share.webp" width="571" height="680" alt="Slack post sharing the new webinar organizers' journey map with a Loom video overview" data-pt-alt={'Publicação no Slack a partilhar o novo journey map dos organizadores de webinars, com um vídeo de apresentação no Loom'} loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<CaseBodyLightbox />

<style>
  /* UWO-specific: Context is a 2-col text+image row. Shared .rwc-*
     layout/typography lives in global.css and the lightbox in
     CaseBodyLightbox.astro. */
  .rwc-challenge {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--dimension-space-48);
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .rwc-challenge { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
